  "issue": {
    "body": "### Describe the bug\r\n\r\nThe cookie created may include \"=\" and be wrongly formatted, ignored by the browser.\r\n\r\n### To reproduce\r\n\r\nstarlette/starlette/middleware/sessions.py:55\r\ndata = b64encode(json.dumps(scope[\"session\"]).encode(\"utf-8\"))\r\n\r\nE.g. when scope[\"session\"] = {\"a\":\"bc\"}\r\ndata becomes \"eyJhIjogImJjIn0=\"\r\nwhich generates a wrong cookie, ignored by the browser.\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\n\r\nEquals sign should not be included in the cookie.\r\n\r\n### Actual behavior\r\n\r\nEquals sign might be included in the cookie.\r\n\r\n### Debugging material\r\n\r\n\r\n### Environment\r\n\r\nPython 3.9.6\r\nMacOS\r\nStarlette Version: 0.14.2\r\n\r\n### Additional context\r\n\r\nActual cookie generated was something like this:\r\n\r\nsession=gICAgIH1cbiAgICB9XG59In0=.YQ5bnw.jlYF8N3XGf8tYCGDzrnZzW4BHPA; path=/; Max-Age=1209600; httponly; samesite=lax\r\n\n\n<!-- POLAR PLEDGE BADGE START -->\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> - We're using [Polar.sh](https://polar.sh/encode) so you can upvote and help fund this issue.\n> - We receive the funding once the issue is completed & confirmed by you.\n> - Thank you in advance for helping prioritize & fund our backlog.\n\n<a href=\"https://polar.sh/encode/starlette/issues/1259\">\n<picture>\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://polar.sh/api/github/encode/starlette/issues/1259/pledge.svg?darkmode=1\">\n  <img alt=\"Fund with Polar\" src=\"https://polar.sh/api/github/encode/starlette/issues/1259/pledge.svg\">\n</picture>\n</a>\n<!-- POLAR PLEDGE BADGE END -->\n",
